msgid "Nothing you can buy, earn or unlock changes a rule, a probability, a limit or what you can see. The rules engine has no idea any of it exists. The only thing supporting the game unlocks that touches a game at all is the ability to <0>host a table with fewer than two humans in it</0>, which is a hosting permission, not an advantage."
